atics-statistics/optimization-theory/modern-optimization/adam-optimizer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evolutionary-algorithms","title":"进化算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/optimization-theory/modern-optimization/evolutionary-algorithms"},{"seq":4,"slug":"optimization-in-deep-learning","title":"深度学习中的优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/optimization-theory/modern-optimization/optimization-in-deep-learning"}]}]}